      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You packed so much in your bag. Try again after emptying your bag.",
      "translation" : "你的背包塞得太满了。清空一些物品后再试。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Please get on with the sprits well~ You should~!",
      "translation" : "好好和精灵相处哦~一定要哦~！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Wow~ you are a young adventurer. I envy you.",
      "translation" : "哇~你真是个年轻的冒险者，真让人羡慕。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ahh~ I think you don't need to have a conversation with me.",
      "translation" : "啊~我想你没必要和我交谈。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome. What can I help you with?",
      "translation" : "欢迎。有什么我能帮你的吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do you know about Sorcerers?",
      "translation" : "你了解妖术师吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Wouldn't it be more comfortable to just live as a scholar? Sorcerers are busy communicating with the spirits and don't have much time to read books...",
      "translation" : "当个学者安稳地生活，不是更舒服吗？妖术师整天忙着和精灵交流，没多少时间看书..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What made you want to be a sorcerer?",
      "translation" : "你为什么想成为妖术师？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The spirit of fire led me here.",
      "translation" : "火之精灵指引我来到这里"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The spirit of water led me here.",
      "translation" : "水之精灵指引我来到这里"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The spirit of earth led me here",
      "translation" : "地之精灵指引我来到这里"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The spirit of meat led me here.",
      "translation" : "肉之精灵指引我来到这里"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That kind of spirit doesn't exist!",
      "translation" : "根本没有那种精灵！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh, I see.",
      "translation" : "哦，原来如此。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You must be born with the natural ability to see that you already communicated with the spirits, or you must be an excellent liar.",
      "translation" : "你可能天生就有看见精灵的能力，已经和精灵交流过了；也可能只是个特别会撒谎的人。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm... Then first, can you write down your name on this list?",
      "translation" : "嗯...首先，能把你的名字写在这张名单上吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Write name.",
      "translation" : "写下名字"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I won't.",
      "translation" : "我不写"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, okay. See you again when you get a chance.",
      "translation" : "好吧。有机会再来见我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So, you are [{0}].",
      "translation" : "那么，你就是[{0}]。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Give me a second to register your name.",
      "translation" : "等我一下，我先登记你的名字。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Talk to me again in a second.",
      "translation" : "稍后再和我说话。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Good, then I'll give you a short explanation about the Sorcerer.",
      "translation" : "好，我先简单介绍一下妖术师。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}], can you handle magic skillfully?",
      "translation" : "[{0}]，你擅长使用魔法吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, I can.",
      "translation" : "是的，我可以"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No, I'm not really good at it.",
      "translation" : "不，我不太擅长"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What!? You don't know how to use magic?",
      "translation" : "什么？！你不会使用魔法？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What are you doing here then? Get out of here. Right now!",
      "translation" : "那你来这里做什么？快出去，现在就走！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Okay, that should be obvious.",
      "translation" : "好，这还用说吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Of course, Sorcerers use magic, too. But, do you know the main difference Sorcerers have from other magical jobs?",
      "translation" : "当然，妖术师也会使用魔法。不过，你知道妖术师和其他魔法职业最大的区别是什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "They know how to sing.",
      "translation" : "他们知道怎么唱歌"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "They're all old fogies.",
      "translation" : "他们都是一群老古董"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "They can deal with the spirits.",
      "translation" : "他们能与精灵沟通"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well maybe some but that's not the main difference.",
      "translation" : "嗯，也许有些人会唱歌，但这不是主要区别。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What! How dare you!?!",
      "translation" : "什么！你竟敢这么说？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That's right. That is the most distinguishing feature that Sorcerers have.",
      "translation" : "没错。这就是妖术师最显著的特征。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When the people who want to be a Sorcerer come, the first thing we do is to check whether they can communicate with spirits or not.",
      "translation" : "想成为妖术师的人来报名时，我们首先会确认他们能不能与精灵沟通。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So that's the basic introduction, so you just need to decide whether or not you want to take the qualification test.",
      "translation" : "基本介绍就到这里。你只需要决定是否参加资格考试。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, it's all up to you. What are you going to do?",
      "translation" : "决定权在你。你打算怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I will take the test.",
      "translation" : "我要参加测试"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll do it later.",
      "translation" : "以后再来"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Okay. ",
      "translation" : "好。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Then I'll hand it over to Karacas who is on the 4th floor. He will guide you through the process of the test.",
      "translation" : "那我会把你交给在4楼的卡拉卡斯。他会指导你完成考试。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Merito]",
      "translation" : "[梅里托]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What? I was sure that you wanted to become a Sorcerer.",
      "translation" : "什么？我还以为你想成为妖术师呢。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Merito",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How about your test? Well, Karacas is a little lazy, so that might bother you some... kkk",
      "translation" : "你的考试怎么样了？卡拉卡斯有点懒，可能会让你觉得麻烦...呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Karacas]",
      "translation" : "[卡拉卡斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh, it seems that you're too heavy. Empty your bag and then come again.",
      "translation" : "你看起来负重太多了。清空背包后再来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You look happy. Have a great journey.",
      "translation" : "你看起来心情不错。祝你旅途愉快。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Is there anything I can do for you?",
      "translation" : "有什么事吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I belong to the Sorcerer association. I don't think you have any business with me.",
      "translation" : "我属于妖术师协会。我想你没什么事要找我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "More people are visiting Geffen Tower these days.",
      "translation" : "最近来吉芬塔的人越来越多了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "....",
      "translation" : "..."
